  "title": "Sage-kama-oire",
  "jp": "\u4e0b\u3052\u938c\uff08\u5927\u5165\u308c\uff09",
  "gloss": "",
  "guidance": "The nuki's end is cut with a \u938c hook on its underside. The mortise is one hook deeper than the nuki, so the nuki is offered up raised, run home and then dropped: the hook falls behind the post's far face and bears on it, so the nuki cannot be pulled back out. A wedge driven in over the nose seats the nuki on the mortise floor and keeps the hook tight. The nuki is housed at its full section with no shoulder \u2014 \u5927\u5165\u308c \u2014 and the mortise runs right through the post, leaving a narrow cheek either side.",
